      "excerpt": "Cameroon's keeper Bihina shines in Wafcon semi-final upset over Morocco. Tanzanian bettors get expert betting tips and odds comparisons for this thrilling event.",
      "body": "Keeper Michaely Bihina\u2019s heroics have sent Cameroon through to the 2026 Women\u2019s Africa Cup of Nations (Wafcon) final after a dramatic penalty shootout victory over hosts Morocco. For bettors in Tanzania, this upset is a golden opportunity to explore fresh betting angles on the Wafcon tournament, especially with the spotlight on Cameroon\u2019s goalkeeper who saved four penalties, including one in extra time.\n\nBihina\u2019s performance was nothing short of spectacular. She denied Morocco\u2019s hopes by saving an extra-time penalty and then three more in the shootout, a feat that has captured the attention of football fans and bettors alike. This result not only shakes up the tournament but also opens up intriguing betting markets for Tanzanian punters who follow CAF competitions closely.\n\n### What This Means for Tanzanian Bettors\n\nTanzania\u2019s betting market is vibrant, with football being the most followed sport, especially leagues like the Tanzania Premier League, CAF Champions League, and major international tournaments such as AFCON and Wafcon. With Michaely Bihina\u2019s standout performance, Cameroon now emerges as a serious contender for the Wafcon title, which changes the dynamics for betting markets in Tanzania.\n\nPunters in Tanzania can look at Cameroon\u2019s odds to win the Wafcon final with fresh eyes. Bookmakers like Betika Tanzania and SportPesa Tanzania are already offering competitive odds on the tournament\u2019s outcome. For example, illustrative market pricing shows Cameroon\u2019s odds trading around 4.50 with Betika Tanzania, while SportPesa Tanzania offers slightly longer odds near 5.00. This difference presents an opportunity for savvy bettors to shop around and maximise potential returns.\n\n### Comparing Odds: Betika Tanzania vs SportPesa Tanzania\n\n| Market                     | Betika Tanzania Odds | SportPesa Tanzania Odds |\n|----------------------------|---------------------|------------------------|